    <guid isPermaLink="false">68d0134f2c82c9dcca7effb6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 22 Sep 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近，美联社宣布停止旗下历史悠久的书评专栏。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这当然并非独有之现象，全球范围内，书评都已走向没落，亦属肉眼可见。</span></p><span></span><p><span>那么原因何在？是否还有转机？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，我们就来聊聊这个话题。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgNqkIwUM24Nyd14bbNII-fjO8PG.png"></figure>]]></description>
