    <guid isPermaLink="false">68862634a9dec925006bf188</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Jul 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>科幻恐怖，结合了科幻和恐怖的混合题材。</span></p><span></span><p><span>听起来空间广阔，但实际热度却不高。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是为什么呢？本期节目，深度解析。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiUP4QrBS9vqfWQfS3jr66bt9TJN.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="203">03:23</a> 科幻恐怖的魅力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="418">06:58</a> 科幻恐怖的核心定义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="692">11:32</a> 科幻恐怖的可塑性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> 为何热度不高？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1691">28:11</a> 一些佳作及未来发展</span></p>]]></description>
