  <item>
    <title>圣像泣血，宗教恐怖为何式微</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6873add593fd2d72b8f5099d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6873add593fd2d72b8f5099d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 14 Jul 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>宗教恐怖，曾经是恐怖作品的热门题材。</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论是《驱魔人》还是《罗斯玛丽的婴儿》，都是永恒经典。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但这些年间，相较于民俗恐怖的大热，宗教恐怖却日渐式微？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这又是什么原因呢？本期节目，我们就来解析一番。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnmK_FHknIuIrkBY-zeydQv3WsCa.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 光与影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="181">03:01</a> 何谓宗教恐怖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="301">05:01</a> 宗教恐怖的内核</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="623">10:23</a> 宗教恐怖的trigger</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="987">16:27</a> 局限性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1314">21:54</a> 代表作解析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2048">34:08</a> 陷入低谷</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6774c79d1e823e72d35da9b1/luX0OQYkJUZUEh_LHAnx9soQTfWq.m4a" length="75066825" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvj4EssMdV92eRSsW_0oKJ22F727.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
