    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Jun 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>恐怖作品的各种类型中，近年来最火的，毫无疑问是民俗恐怖。</span></p><span></span><p><span>该类别不仅作品数量多，基数大，并且无论是精品的数量还是比例，亦是独占鳌头。</span></p><span></span><p><span>此类作品的魅力何在？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，就来聊聊这个话题。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsGppwc23LAkwGMViPYxulWeJxmp.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="156">02:36</a> 民俗恐怖佳作多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="723">12:03</a> 共鸣的恐怖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a> 村八分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1351">22:31</a> 融合的恐怖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1747">29:07</a> 无序的恐怖</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6774c79d1e823e72d35da9b1/lgJiLlRnkzllENXDYQEilRoVTv_w.m4a" length="63851277" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:33:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqVb0Mxmew9jCzzE4xmCO0lrojSq.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
