  <item>
    <title>血色獠牙，叩问吸血鬼题材的隐喻</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/684428936dbe9284e740584f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">684428936dbe9284e740584f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Jun 2025 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>吸血鬼题材的，是恐怖作品中被广泛使用的一种。</span></p><span></span><p><span>并且在很大程度上，该题材已经超越恐怖作品范畴，成为流行文化的一部分。</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论是游戏抑或电影，乃至漫画，吸血鬼们和他们的始祖德古拉，都是人气之选。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但吸血鬼题材火热的背后，是否隐藏着什么原因呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，我们就来聊聊这个话题。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fic6Hr_U0v4zpVucIR3jWdADaG5B.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">01:33</a> 数量庞大的吸血鬼题材作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> 吸血鬼传说的起源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="307">05:07</a> 经典作品速览</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="455">07:35</a> 德古拉的起源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">13:55</a> 德古拉的具象化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1005">16:45</a> 假面舞会规则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1171">19:31</a> 并不恐怖的吸血鬼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1433">23:53</a> 何以恐怖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1891">31:31</a> 结语</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6774c79d1e823e72d35da9b1/lnE4RhOEjc7tNXOtIveADuMWueKH.m4a" length="62004981" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:32:10</itunes:duration>
